  "body": "Currently, there is effectively no limit to the size of a `/_matrix/federation/v1/send/{txnId}` request, because some EDUs (eg presence, receipts) can reasonably contain an unlimited quantity of data. I think we should specify some limits to the amount of data such EDUs can contain.",
